  "label": "User projected onto the grieving woman in the visual material",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman in mourning, as the image of grief is used to evoke an emotional response that is then tied to the misleading text about Muslim victims. The user is implicitly invited to identify with the emotional state depicted, even though the text manipulates the context of that emotion.",
